# lab.surface: the merge game (iron + gears) on the lab surface of the test map, so fk build's
# diff and apply can be watched live (/lab). The lab rules: free materials, direct building.
# The lab surface is 2048x2048 (x and y from -1024 to 1023): every plot stays inside it.
surface  lab
# (3.1) `mode lab` was here: a surface has properties now: free, and the paste's force
free
force    lab
terrain  none
catalog  base

place iron  = iron  plot 200,400 19x24          # 19 wide: Rory's power at 219,408 stands beside it
place gears = gears plot 222,400 16x16

robots works: cover iron, gears

# Rory powered both factories with the editor (2026-10-20): two energy interfaces, adopted as
# this surface's infra (lab.fkp, cover rory): rory/e0 at 220,409 feeds the gears grid, rory/e1
# at 198,417 the iron grid. They are design now, so a build keeps them.
